{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19272","headline":"遥贺白宾客分司初到洛中戏呈冯尹 · 刘禹锡","name":"遥贺白宾客分司初到洛中戏呈冯尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西辞望苑去，东占洛阳才。\n度岭无愁思，看山不懊来。\n冥鸿何所慕，辽鹤乍飞廻。\n洗竹通新迳，携琴上旧台。\n尘埃长者撤，风月故人杯。\n闻道龙门峻，还因上客开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}